#: game/quests/depot_master/request_air_scrubbers.tres
msgid "Air scrubbers"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_air_scrubbers.tres
msgid "Every air scrubber on this station has a Halcyne core, and nine of them are wearing out. 60 Halcyne would replace them all."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_air_scrubbers.tres
msgid "Bring Kade 60 Halcyne for the air scrubbers."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_air_scrubbers.tres
msgid "60 Halcyne. Nine new cores. Everyone aboard breathes a little easier, even if they never find out why."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_cold_stores.tres
msgid "Cold stores"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_cold_stores.tres
msgid "The cold stores need Pallin for their cooling lines. If they fail, we lose a month of food, so I'd like 100 Pallin before they do."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_cold_stores.tres
msgid "Bring Kade 100 Pallin for the cold stores."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_cold_stores.tres
msgid "100 Pallin. That's one month of food I don't have to worry about."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_filter_frames.tres
msgid "Filter frames"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_filter_frames.tres
msgid "The water recyclers' filter frames are made of Kyrite, and three of them cracked this week. I need 150 Kyrite to replace them."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_filter_frames.tres
msgid "Bring Kade 150 Kyrite for the filter frames."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_filter_frames.tres
msgid "150 Kyrite, logged. That's three new frames and two spare ones."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_hull_patches.tres
msgid "Hull patches"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_hull_patches.tres
msgid "Debris hit the docking ring yesterday, in four places. The patches are made of Olvane, so I need 120 of it."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_hull_patches.tres
msgid "Bring Kade 120 Olvane for the hull patches."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_hull_patches.tres
msgid "120 Olvane. Four patches, and the ring holds pressure again. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_power_cells.tres
msgid "Power cells"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_power_cells.tres
msgid "The station's power cells are made with Duskine, and the night shift has been running on reserve for a week. I need 60 Duskine."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_power_cells.tres
msgid "Bring Kade 60 Duskine for the power cells."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_power_cells.tres
msgid "60 Duskine. Twelve new cells, and the night shift gets its lights back."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_pump_seals.tres
msgid "Pump seals"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_pump_seals.tres
msgid "The hydroponics' pumps need Tessar seals, and we have six left for forty pumps. 100 Tessar would cover the rest of the year."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_pump_seals.tres
msgid "Bring Kade 100 Tessar for the pump seals."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_pump_seals.tres
msgid "100 Tessar. Forty pumps, all sealed. The greenhouse crew owes you a salad."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_scanner_lenses.tres
msgid "Scanner lenses"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_scanner_lenses.tres
msgid "The clinic's scanners need Vyrel for their lenses. Two of their three scanners are down, so 80 Vyrel would help a lot of people."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_scanner_lenses.tres
msgid "Bring Kade 80 Vyrel for the scanner lenses."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/depot_master/request_scanner_lenses.tres
msgid "80 Vyrel. All three scanners will be running again by tomorrow."
msgstr ""

