#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "A good welcome"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "About that job..."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "I've got a job for you, and it starts small. Ostra's workshops are running out of Kyrite, and without it, the repairs stop."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "So our first 300 Kyrite go to Kade at the depot. The colony looks after us, so we look after the colony."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Do that well, and I'll have more for you after."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Bring Kade 300 Kyrite at the depot on Waypost Ostra."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Brannik's Kyrite"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Three hundred Kyrite from Brannik's crew. He told me you'd come, and it's already in my books."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "That keeps the workshops going for about two weeks. I don't say that lightly."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "And since you're here: our surveyors left markers in Hollow Mire last month, and two nests have grown right next to them. Brannik said you'd see to it."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Destroy the two nests by the survey markers in Hollow Mire."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Brannik here. The survey markers are somewhere down there, with the two nests beside them. Clear them out, and watch your back."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Brannik here. The survey markers are somewhere down there, with the two nests beside them. Clear them out, and watch each other's backs."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "The survey nests"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Kade will be pleased. Those markers cost the colony more than you'd think."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Now, something of mine. On landfall day, a lander went down in Redscar Flats, with the colony's weapon blueprints aboard. Its crates ended up all over the flats."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "One of those blueprints is in three pieces somewhere in those crates. Bring them to me. And Tamsin doesn't talk about that day, so don't ask her."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Both nests are down. Good work. Now get back aboard in one piece."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Both nests are down. Good work. Now get back aboard in one piece, all of you."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Recover the three blueprint fragments from the crates in Redscar Flats."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "The lander's crates are spread out down there. Open every one you find. Three pieces, that's all we need."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "The lander's crates are spread out down there. Split up if you like, and open every one you find. Three pieces, that's all we need."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "The blueprint"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Three pieces. That's a whole blueprint again."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "It's the shotgun the colony's guards carried. It doesn't reach far, but nothing gets close to you twice."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "I have my reasons for wanting you ready for what's further in. Build it, and show me it works."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "That's all three pieces. Bring them home, and don't let anything take them off you."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "That's all three pieces. Bring them home, all of you, and don't let anything take them off you."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Build the shotgun from its blueprint."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "The shotgun"
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "There it is. Treat it well, and it'll do the same for you."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Try it on the range first. And ask me about it any time: I know a trick or two about loading shells."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Brannik here. I hear the shotgun is built. Come and show it to me."
msgstr ""

#: game/quests/quartermaster/colony_arms.tres
msgid "Brannik here. I hear the shotgun is built. Come and show it to me, all of you."
msgstr ""

